# src/packages/control-ui/tests

## Purpose
Groups Control UI automated behavior tests that validate user-visible and integration contracts beyond isolated unit logic.

## Contents
Contains end-to-end test suites, fixtures, and test-only support beneath feature-specific test directories.

## Interfaces and dependencies
Executed by frontend test tooling against the built/development Control UI with mocked or controlled backend/network dependencies as configured.

## Invariants
Tests are non-production assets, must be deterministic and isolated, must clean up routes/state they install, and should assert observable contracts rather than incidental implementation details.